{
  "id": "E148",
  "title": "Playing on Your Phone Again?",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-09-07",
  "synopsis": "Why does Fangfang spend so much time playing on his phone?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/519/e53671e91e665d690136ca0d35f14a8dd17b54ad.mp3?1504501083",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你又在玩手机\n\n圆圆：方方，你又在玩手机?\n方方：对不起，是的。王者荣耀这个游戏特别好玩，我有空就会玩一会儿。\n圆圆：可是，我觉得你需要休息一下。为什么不出去散散步呢？\n方方：外面太热了，我实在不想出去。\n圆圆：我觉得，你快对手机游戏上瘾了。对了，今天晚上我们有个聚会，你不记得了吗？\n方方：哎呀，糟糕！你不提醒我，我就真的忘得一干二净了。\n圆圆：我们赶紧准备一下吧。\n方方：好的，稍等一下，我再玩一局。",
    "traditional": "你又在玩手機\n\n圓圓：方方，你又在玩手機?\n方方：對不起，是的。王者榮耀這個遊戲特別好玩，我有空就會玩一會兒。\n圓圓：可是，我覺得你需要休息一下。為什麼不出去散散步呢？\n方方：外面太熱了，我實在不想出去。\n圓圓：我覺得，你快對手機遊戲上癮了。對了，今天晚上我們有個聚會，你不記得了嗎？\n方方：哎呀，糟糕！你不提醒我，我就真的忘得一乾二淨了。\n圓圓：我們趕緊準備一下吧。\n方方：好的，稍等一下，我再玩一局。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are you playing on your phone again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "圆圆：方方，你又在玩手机?",
      "traditional": "圓圓：方方，你又在玩手機?",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán fāng fāng nǐ yòu zài wán shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Fangfang, are you playing on your phone again?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "方方：对不起，是的。",
      "traditional": "方方：對不起，是的。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng duì bu qǐ shì de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "王者荣耀这个游戏特别好玩，我有空就会玩一会儿。",
      "traditional": "王者榮耀這個遊戲特別好玩，我有空就會玩一會兒。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zhě róng yào zhè ge yóu xì tè bié hǎo wán wǒ yǒu kòng jiù huì wán yí huì'r",
      "english": "Fangfang: Yeah, sorry."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There is an interesting mobile game called King of Glory. I always play it when I have free time."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "圆圆：可是，我觉得你需要休息一下。为什么不出去散散步呢？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：可是，我覺得你需要休息一下。為什麼不出去散散步呢？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán kě shì wǒ jué de nǐ xū yào xiū xi yí xià wèi shén me bù chū qù sàn sàn bù ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: But I think you need to take a rest. Why not go out and take a walk?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "方方：外面太热了，我实在不想出去。",
      "traditional": "方方：外面太熱了，我實在不想出去。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng wài miàn tài rè le wǒ shí zài bù xiǎng chū qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: It’s too hot outside. I really don’t want to go out."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "圆圆：我觉得，你快对手机游戏上瘾了。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：我覺得，你快對手機遊戲上癮了。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán wǒ jué de nǐ kuài duì shǒu jī yóu xì shàng yǐn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "对了，今天晚上我们有个聚会，你不记得了吗？",
      "traditional": "對了，今天晚上我們有個聚會，你不記得了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "duì le jīn tiān wǎn shang wǒ men yǒu ge jù huì nǐ bú jì de le ma",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: I think you are addicted to playing mobile games."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "By the way, don’t you remember we are going to have a party tonight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "方方：哎呀，糟糕！你不提醒我，我就真的忘得一干二净了。",
      "traditional": "方方：哎呀，糟糕！你不提醒我，我就真的忘得一乾二淨了。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng āi yā zāo gāo nǐ bù tí xǐng wǒ wǒ jiù zhēn de wàng de yì gān èr jìng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Oh, darn it. If you hadn't reminded me I would totally have forgotten."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "圆圆：我们赶紧准备一下吧。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：我們趕緊準備一下吧。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán wǒ men gǎn jǐn zhǔn bèi yí xià ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Let’s go prepare for the party."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "方方：好的，稍等一下，我再玩一局。",
      "traditional": "方方：好的，稍等一下，我再玩一局。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng hǎo de shāo děng yí xià wǒ zài wán yì jú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Fine, just wait one moment. I want to play one more hand."
    }
  ],
